Summary of modifications made by the Syncra project:

- Rebranded the application from "BubbleTranslate" to "Syncra"
  (new applicationId `com.syncra.app`, new launcher icon and mascot).
- Removed the bundled on-device translation models (ML Kit) and the
  associated Google Play Services dependencies.
- Replaced translation with OpenRouter Chat Completions API calls;
  the user supplies their own API key.
- Rewrote the floating overlay UI (Compose), including the mascot
  character, the settings panel, and the per-message translation layer.
- Added incremental input translation, sentence-aware batching,
  a whole-text manual translation button, and a locked target language.
- Added a local translation cache with a one-tap "clear cache" action.
- Added dark mode support, release signing configuration, and
  retry/timeout handling for network requests.
- Fixed a number of bugs in screen-text collection, input-box writing,
  and overlay lifecycle.

